# Testing Deltas (Beyond Boost)

Boost already defines baseline Laravel and PHPUnit behavior. Keep this rule
focused on Open-Locker specifics.

## Domain-Critical Scenarios

- Prioritize feature coverage for compartment access, opening, provisioning,
  command responses, and event-sourced projections.
- Assert both the API/domain outcome and the relevant projected persistence
  state or published side effect.
- Include authorization checks for user vs. admin-only endpoints.

## Integration Boundaries

- Mock MQTT publishers and other external boundaries where appropriate.
- Backend tests must not require `locker-client` or live Modbus hardware.

## Practical Scope

- Default to feature tests; only add unit tests for isolated pure logic.
- Run focused tests with `composer test:filter Name`; use `composer test` for
  the complete PHPUnit suite.
